From 8677dcd8ee46222ec914dd4b4b8eb937ce290983 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "yang.wang" <yang.wang@deepcomputing.io>
Date: Wed, 16 Apr 2025 11:06:18 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 283/540] Enhance ES8326 audio support for Eswin EIC7702

- Add 11.025kHz, 22.05kHz, 32kHz sample rates in ES8326 codec.
- Optimize MCLK/BCLK for 44.1kHz/48kHz in I2S driver.
- Remove hardcoded clock settings in device tree.
- Set DMA period count to 4.
- Fix 16-bit audio clock cycles in I2S.
- Add dynamic sysclk in ES8326 driver.

Signed-off-by: yang.wang <yang.wang@deepcomputing.io>
---
 .../eswin/eic7702-deepcomputing-fml13v03.dts  |   2 -
 sound/soc/codecs/es8326.c                     |  24 ++-
 sound/soc/eswin/esw-dma.c                     |   2 +-
 sound/soc/eswin/esw-i2s.c                     | 150 +++++++++---------
 4 files changed, 100 insertions(+), 78 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/riscv/boot/dts/eswin/eic7702-deepcomputing-fml13v03.dts b/arch/riscv/boot/dts/eswin/eic7702-deepcomputing-fml13v03.dts
